Why these files differ from the rest of the repository: the Linux kernel only
lets a BPF program call GPL-only kernel functions if the program declares a
GPL-compatible licence, and Apache 2.0 is not one.

Everything else in this repository, including the Makefile in this directory,
is licensed under the Apache License 2.0. See ../../LICENSE.

vmlinux.h is generated from Linux kernel type information. It is not covered by
the licences above, and the Kuvera Authors claim no copyright in it.
